# armour/shared/pauldron_cop4_r: the large COP pauldron on the right shoulder (cop.4; FORGE-SHOULDERS, STYLE_P2 28.3).
# a round cast disc: a dome lit at its top-left over a dark crease and the rolled rim's lit lip, round at the top
# and the bottom (FOUNDRY, bronze); never sharp.
# Rides the lean and the bob and lifts a pixel on wind-ups (`up`). Finish regions: R the rolled rim, G the dome's crown, N the crease, P the dome's face.
# Shared by the man and the woman (D10). Generated by FORGE-SHOULDERS gen.py from shapes.py (re-run, never hand-edit
# the derived views). Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
# The rest views repeat as `when shoulder-cop` overlays: the shape's own drawing, which the body's cut skips.
use person
role pauldron cop.4
layer armNear
anchor shoulderR
keys pauld
z 5
side R

